    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Gdyby and the conditional",
     "texto": [
      "**Gdyby** introduces a hypothetical condition: **gdybym miał czas** («if I had time», said by a man), **gdybym miała czas** (said by a woman).",
      "In a full sentence a comma is written between the condition and the result. The endings **-bym/-byśmy** mark person and number."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
